      "cooked": "<p>When customising the Sales Partner form, the ID is not generating as a random or alphanumeric value. Instead, it defaults to the Sales Partner Name.</p>\n<p>Expected Behavior</p>\n<p>The system should generate a unique random or alphanumeric ID for each Sales Partner.</p>\n<p>Actual Behavior</p>\n<p>The ID field is automatically set to the Sales Partner Name instead of generating a random/alphanumeric ID.</p>\n<p>Steps to Reproduce</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Go to the Sales Partner form.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Try to create a new Sales Partner with ID generation enabled.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Observe that the ID is set to the same value as the Sales Partner Name.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Screenshot</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/104137988/491285753-6b7867fd-e144-4e64-8df8-cf7557f6798e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NTgyNjc3MjIsIm5iZiI6MTc1ODI2NzQyMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMDQxMzc5ODgvNDkxMjg1NzUzLTZiNzg2N2ZkLWUxNDQtNGU2NC04ZGY4LWNmNzU1N2Y2Nzk4ZS5wbmc_.3AjgG4j50NkpapAi4E3wnuXHTmr7RS2wm6z7PSWHdDw\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/104137988/491285753-6b7867fd-e144-4e64-8df8-cf7557f6798e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NTgyNjc3MjIsIm5iZiI6MTc1ODI2NzQyMiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMDQxMzc5ODgvNDkxMjg1NzUzLTZiNzg2N2ZkLWUxNDQtNGU2NC04ZGY4LWNmNzU1N2Y2Nzk4ZS5wbmc_.3AjgG4j50NkpapAi4E3wnuXHTmr7RS2wm6z7PSWHdDw\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"690\" height=\"335\"></a></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-481099-module-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-481099-module-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Module</h3>\n<p>selling</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-481099-version-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-481099-version-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Version</h3>\n<p>ERPNext: v15.54.5 (version-15)</